WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
I am back with Norm,

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.840
outside an alley next to a pub,

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.840
which is prime fighting territory.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.640
And Norm is going to teach me some more about stage fighting.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:10.320
Yes!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.180
What are you going to teach me?

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.220
--How to slap someone. --Okay.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.320
So, I'm going to slap you in the face.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.600
Okay, I'm going to take my classes off.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.960
That's a very good idea.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:17.960
Alright.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.740
Because the key ingredient in stage slapping

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.620
is that you react.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.260
I will pretty much do very little.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.500
But you have to sell it by doing the "Woaah!"

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.740
Yea, okay.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:32.340
-- Got it? --Okay.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.580
So, key ingredient number one:

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.580
I will tell you, that I'm about to slap you...

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.820
-- Okay --By putting my hand on your face.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:39.320
Okay.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:44.360
Then, I will slap my hand, not your face.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.860
Okay, I trust you here!

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.700
--So, don't be scared. --Okay.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.860
--When my hand leaves your face... --Yep!

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:51.580
Move!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.400
--Alright. -- That way obviously.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.060
That way: not in the hell.

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.260
That way! --Got it.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:57.040
--Ready? --Yep.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.200
3, 2, 1

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:04.520
--Can I try this then? --Yes.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.780
--I'l sell it this way. --Yep.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.020
--So, you put your hand there... --Yeah.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:07.560
And then you do that.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.060
Yes!

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:08.640
Okay!

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:12.180
--But at the point of which I feel your hand leave my face... --I didn't do that.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.180
I throw myself.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:13.740
Okay!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.240
Yeah, yeah,  yeah,  yeah?

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:18.560
Jesus!

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.920
That's brilliant. Do you want to do one more?

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:23.820
Okay, okay, one more, one more.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.340
--Okay. --For the camera.

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:25.840
Yeah!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.520
That is so much fun!

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:30.540
That is how to stage slap someone!

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.460
--Thank you, Norm! -- You're welcome.

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:32.260
Take it.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:34.360
That is something you might not know!

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.180
[Closed captions by MM.
